  "content": "\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/banner.png\" alt=\"失落的飾品 重製版橫幅\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=53051224\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/NbAJwj8RHg\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@yesman4100\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/youtube.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/Antikythera-Studios/lost-trinkets-renewed\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/github.png\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lost-trinkets-renewed\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/shared/icons/curseforge.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /></a>\n</center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></center>\n\n## 失落的飾品 重製版\n\n<center><em>《失落的飾品》加入了70多種極其稀有的可解鎖飾品，擁有各種實用的能力供你遊玩。這些飾品會透過賦予你強大的技能，徹底改變你的遊戲玩法。</em></center>\n\n**如何解鎖飾品：** 飾品會在進行各種活動時隨機解鎖，例如戰鬥、對抗Boss、交易、挖掘礦石、砍伐樹木以及農耕。每種活動都有各自的掉落機率，某些更具風險的活動可能會更快地讓你獲得飾品。（請查看設定檔以調整不同的解鎖機率至符合你的喜好）\n\n**如何開啟/查看你的飾品：** 預設情況下，你可以按下鍵盤上的「R」鍵來開啟飾品圖形介面。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></center>\n\n## ✨ 功能特色\n\n- **豐富的飾品庫** - 探索、解鎖並試用各種能為你的遊戲體驗增添樂趣的飾品！\n- **自訂流派** - 自由組合搭配出不同的流派，徹底改變你的遊戲玩法！\n- **變得更強** - 透過每個飾品獲得更強大的能力，輕鬆擊敗敵人！\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></center>\n\n## 📷 遊戲截圖\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/Screenshot_20260708_220716.png\" alt=\"遊戲截圖\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/1212.png\" alt=\"遊戲截圖\"></center>\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></center>\n\n## 📥 安裝方式\n\n**需要同時安裝於客戶端與伺服器！**\n\n**Forge/Neoforge 需要：**\n\n- [Architectury API](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api)\n\n**Fabric 需要：**\n\n- [Architectury API](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api)\n- [Forge Config API Port](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port)\n- [Fabric API](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api)\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></center>\n\n## ⚙️ 設定檔\n\n大部分選項都可以直接編輯 `.minecraft/config/losttrinkets-common.toml` 中的設定檔來修改。你可以在那裡微調模組以符合你的喜好，也可以更改飾品的解鎖速率。\n\n> **提示：** 對設定檔所做的修改將在下次載入世界時生效。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></center>\n\n## ❤️ 致謝\n\n由 **Antikythera Studios** 精心移植並維護。\n這是《Lost Trinkets》的 1.20+ 移植版本，原版由 owmii 為 Forge 1.16.1-1.16.5 開發。該專案採用 LGPL 授權，而 owmii 自 2021 年起便已停更，因此我決定接手這個模組。現已支援 1.20+ 的 Forge/Neoforge 與 Fabric。\n\n喜歡這個模組嗎？在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上給個 ⭐ 推薦，對我們來說比你想像中更有幫助。\n\n<center><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/divider.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></center>\n\n<center><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2724\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Antikythera-Studios/atk-resources/main/pages/data/lost-trinkets-renewed/assets/support.png\" alt=\"贊助與合作夥伴\"></a></center>",
